== Introduction ==

=== Abstract ===

This document proposes additional fields for [[bip-0174.mediawiki|BIP 174]] PSBTv0 and [[bip-0370.mediawiki|BIP 370]] PSBTv2 that allow for cross-input signature aggregation as specified in [[bip-0460.mediawiki|BIP 460]].
The fields carry the aggregation mode of an input, the individual signatures of half-aggregation, and the public nonces and partial signatures of full-aggregation.
The document also specifies how the PSBT roles sign and finalize aggregation groups.

